---
description: Flyer Studio architecture rules
globs:
  - src/agents/flyer/**
  - src/platform/flyer_*.py
  - web/frontend/src/sections/flyer/**
  - web/backend/app/routers/flyer.py
alwaysApply: false
---

Read and enforce `docs/governance/projects/flyer-studio.md`.

Models own visual generation, layout exploration, copy interpretation, creative
alternatives, image understanding and style recommendations. Deterministic
Flyer systems own exact dimensions, original-QR preservation, fabrication
detection, price/promotion validation, brand constraints, file-format checks,
OCR/visual QA, retry and fallback policy, approval state, export requirements
and audit.

Presumed NO-GO: a second generation pipeline, a parallel approval store, a QR
regeneration path where preservation is required, an alternate fabrication
detector, a separate retry/orchestration framework, or bypassing the OCR and
approval gates.

These rules apply to Flyer paths only. Never apply them to Catering Studio.
